WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The window shows the session records

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.500
In the session buffer, C-c C-t lists the sessions, and typing narrows them to notes

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:14.800
The window now shows notes, and its tab is selected

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.600
C-c C-t again, back to records

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.200
records is back in the window
